     "content": {
      "size": 4419,
      "mimeType": "application/json",
      "compression": 3035,
      "text": "{\"data\":{\"id\":\"01a0f30c-4612-708b-9cd4-062e94e2b317\",\"topic_id\":\"01a0f30c-45f8-7023-b9ac-b30d80035fd5\",\"title\":\"CF88 - T\\u00edtulo II - Direitos e Garantias\",\"word_count\":234,\"plain_preview\":\"Direitos e Garantias Fundamentais. Art. 5\\u00ba caput. Princ\\u00edpio da legalidade. Inviolabilidade do domic\\u00edlio. Rem\\u00e9dios constitucionais. Direitos Sociais. N\",\"source_document_id\":\"01a0f30c-460e-722f-b1a2-00bcec4a4f1d\",\"last_ai_transform_at\":null,\"cards_generated_at\":\"2026-09-24T16:01:02.000000Z\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-24T16:01:02.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-24T16:01:02.000000Z\",\"content\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"callout\",\"attrs\":{\"type\":\"info\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"\\u2139\\ufe0f \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Gerado por IA\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \\u2014 revise antes de memorizar\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"attrs\":{\"level\":2},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Direitos e Garantias Fundamentais (p\\u00e1g. 1)\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"O T\\u00edtulo II da CF\\/88 organiza os direitos fundamentais em cinco cap\\u00edtulos: direitos individuais e coletivos, sociais, de nacionalidade, pol\\u00edticos e partidos pol\\u00edticos.\"}]},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"attrs\":{\"level\":3},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Art. 5\\u00ba \\u2014 caput (p\\u00e1g. 2)\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Todos s\\u00e3o iguais perante a lei, sem distin\\u00e7\\u00e3o de qualquer natureza, garantindo-se aos \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"brasileiros e aos estrangeiros residentes no Pa\\u00eds\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" a inviolabilidade do direito \\u00e0 vida, \\u00e0 liberdade, \\u00e0 igualdade, \\u00e0 seguran\\u00e7a e \\u00e0 propriedade.\"}]},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"attrs\":{\"level\":3},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Princ\\u00edpio da legalidade (p\\u00e1g. 3)\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Ningu\\u00e9m ser\\u00e1 obrigado a fazer ou deixar de fazer alguma coisa sen\\u00e3o em virtude de lei (art. 5\\u00ba, II).\"}]},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"attrs\":{\"level\":3},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Inviolabilidade do domic\\u00edlio (p\\u00e1g. 5)\"}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Flagrante delito ou desastre: a qualquer hora.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Prestar socorro: a qualquer hora.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Determina\\u00e7\\u00e3o judicial: somente durante o dia.\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"attrs\":{\"level\":3},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Rem\\u00e9dios constitucionais (p\\u00e1g. 12)\"}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Habeas corpus \\u2014 liberdade de locomo\\u00e7\\u00e3o (LXVIII).\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Mandado de seguran\\u00e7a \\u2014 direito l\\u00edquido e certo (LXIX).\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Habeas data \\u2014 informa\\u00e7\\u00f5es pessoais (LXXII).\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Mandado de injun\\u00e7\\u00e3o \\u2014 falta de norma regulamentadora (LXXI).\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A\\u00e7\\u00e3o popular \\u2014 qualquer cidad\\u00e3o (LXXIII).\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"attrs\":{\"level\":2},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Direitos Sociais (p\\u00e1g. 18)\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Art. 6\\u00ba: educa\\u00e7\\u00e3o, sa\\u00fade, alimenta\\u00e7\\u00e3o, trabalho, moradia, transporte, lazer, seguran\\u00e7a, previd\\u00eancia social, prote\\u00e7\\u00e3o \\u00e0 maternidade e \\u00e0 inf\\u00e2ncia, assist\\u00eancia aos desamparados.\"}]},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"attrs\":{\"level\":2},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Nacionalidade (p\\u00e1g. 21)\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Brasileiros natos (art. 12, I) e naturalizados (art. 12, II). Cargos privativos de brasileiro nato: Presidente e Vice, Presidentes da C\\u00e2mara e do Senado, Ministro do STF, carreira diplom\\u00e1tica, oficial das For\\u00e7as Armadas e Ministro de Estado da Defesa.\"}]}]}}}"
     },
